      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-sound-theme</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-sound-theme for compilation:</para>

      <para>Change the theme name so we don't have to use the installer, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="configure">sed -e 's/@ThemeName@/COSMIC/' src/index.theme.in > src/index.theme
</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">mkdir -pv /usr/share/sounds/COSMIC &amp;&amp;

cp -v src/index.theme /usr/share/sounds/COSMIC &amp;&amp;
cp -rv src/stereo/. /usr/share/sounds/COSMIC/</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

